{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張、京都でのリアルミーグリ\nありがとうございました！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobt0GQ2q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張🌻\n珍しくカチモリヘアしてみた^ ^\nみんな褒めてくれたからまたどこかでやろうかな😳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobzgQrhr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして本日は京都でした！\n楽しい時間だったね〜ありがとう😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なかなか着ない、甘め系統のお洋服だったからずっとソワソワしてた😳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobjTq9R0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob87PwWf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵なお花もありがとう💐\n色んな想いがこもってるんだな〜と思いながら見てます。\n特大の愛🫶🏻ありがとう😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んな写真は、乃木メで送ってますので\n是非気になったら覗いてみて👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オンラインでも、リアルでも\nこれからも色々な場所で会えるの楽しみにしてるよ〜💘"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！\n本日、21時〜\nフジテレビ系「逃走中」出演します！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobMMrY3O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⬆️緊張してる顔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "豪華すぎる出演者の皆様とご一緒に🙇🏻‍♀️\n茉央と頑張ったよー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://tver.jp/live/simul/lekbh33c4g"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TVerさんでリアルタイム配信も！\nよろしくお願いします🙇"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山、盛り上げてね〜📣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では、また会いましょう👋🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の一曲。\n夏が帰る  /  aiko"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.5.2"}], "source": "official"}